IP CAM Controller is designed to give you straightforward and hopefully a cool way to view and control your IP camera by providing Tap to Center (or Tap to Move, depends on camera model) - just tapping on the image and camera moves.

We are actively adding more features, please stay tuned.

Features
- Tap to Center: camera centers to the position where you just tapped; or Tap to Move for camera does not support TTC: moves to the direction (1 out of 4 or 8) against the center;
- Multiview, controlling multiple cameras in one screen;
- Motion detection, whenever  your camera has moment, alert you by vibration and push notification;
- Full screen mode when phone in landscape;
- Save snapshot to your camera roll;
- Unlimited number of cameras and multiviews;
- Share camera access by file or link;
- Support a wide range of cameras in almost all major brands in the world.

Partial list of supported camera brands:
