Swift Recovery helps you organize, store and move files and makes it easy to clean your phone's memory to optimize its performance. It also allows you to browse and access files by category.

Swift Recovery recovers deleted photos and other files. An advanced image recovery tool ensures that your photos are recovered even if you accidentally deleted them. The search algorithm used for the application is very efficient because it takes less time and works more efficiently. 

- No need for rooting, high quality file recovery;
- Safe and easy recovery of lost photos and files;
- Face ID/Touch ID authentication;
- Synchronization of data in iCloud;
- File scanning.
